                <property key="text">
                  <object type="util.attribute.Attribute">
                    <property key="value">
                      <object type="str" value="The override for the indici access method.&#10;&#10;:param key: The attribute name.&#10;:type key: str&#10;:returns: The value associated with *key*, which could be *NOVALUE* if the&#10;  the key exists, but here is not value associated with it (ie: the value&#10;  was not inherited via the *NOINHERIT* restriction.&#10;:rtype: SerializableType&#10;:raises KeyError: if the key doesn't exist.&#10;&#10;Calls *self.getAttr()* and returns the value it finds (if any) -- or,&#10;if this object has a value of its own, that, at once: *getAttr()* would&#10;give that value too (whatever it inherits, and whatever its restriction),&#10;but first looks up what it inherits (eg: for the note), which is slow for&#10;something with many ancestors, asked often (eg: a name, for a label)." />
                    </property>
                    <property key="type" type="str" value="None" />
                    <property key="restriction" type="str" value="None" />
                  </object>
                </property>
              </object>
            </property>
